## Published system prompts of claude.ai

Reading them prompted four rules (PS-017). They were rewritten from our own
practice on 2026-08-18, each resting on evidence from this repository and
folded into our own numbering — P6, G6 and the formatting section of
`core/OUTPUT.md`. No text of theirs ships, and none of their wording remains.
The acknowledgement stays because the questions were theirs.
